  "gitCommitMessage": "fix: disable newArchEnabled (Android compat) + restore GPS\n\nNew Architecture (Fabric/JSI) has compatibility issues on Android with\nExpo SDK 54 — causes instant white-screen crash before React renders.\nDisabled globally until all native deps are verified arch-compatible.\nGPS code restored now that the real root cause is identified.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
